blocks.zh:
解决这一问题需要应对两个相互关联的挑战:
(一) 保持对所观测到的几何的忠诚;
(二) 将完成程度扩大至任何物理场景大小。
最近,诸如DUST3R(王等,2024年)及其变体(Leroy等,2024年;Wang等,2025年b;Wang等,2025年a;Yang等,2025年;Sun等,2024年;Keetha等,2025年;Wang等,2026年)以及在线SLAM系统(DROID-SLAM(Teed & Deng,2021年)和VGGT-SLAM(Maggio等,2025年)等,通过对模型和培训数据进行缩放,直接从图像观测中递回3D点,从而得以在单一前方获得密集点的场景云。
然而,完成并非其制定的一部分,因此无人观察的区域仍然是大洞;
限制它们在许多下游应用中的应用。

blocks.en:
Unlike image-conditioned 3D generators ( Zhang et al., 2024 ; Hunyuan3D et al., 2025a ; Xiang et al., 2024 ; Xiang et al., 2025 ) ,
we condition scene completion directly on partial point observations.
This is advantageous for several reasons:
(1) Completeness : the observed points delineate the visible scene boundary, providing direct geometric evidence of where completion is needed;
(2) Accuracy : the condition is directly grounded in 3D geometry, maintaining better fidelity to the visible geometry;
(3) Efficiency : the observed points 𝒫 = { 𝒑 i } i = 1 N \mathcal{P}=\{\bm{p}_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N} can be uniformly subsampled to a fixed size N N , avoiding conditioning costs that grow with the number of input images;
and (4) Composability : point-based inputs can be chunked for scalable local processing, and the outputs can be directly merged in the same scene coordinate frame.
In particular, we take a hybrid conditioning approach via (1) global cross-attention to anchor tokens encoded from the point cloud and (2) local spatial injection of visible-voxel evidence into the structure latent;
both paths are shown in Figure 2 .
The two pathways are ablated in Section 4 .

